          "HR Coordinators starts the direct deposit setup verification shift with a queue pass by age, owner, and missing evidence. The HR coordinator assigns every unowned case before starting new work and checks the signed direct deposit form against the request. A handoff is complete only when the receiver acknowledges it and the next action is written. The end-of-shift note should leave a queue that needs no chat history."
