          "Test one closed direct deposit setup verification case each week by rebuilding it from the evidence map. The reviewer should find the payroll system profile, the decision to release or hold the payroll profile, and the confirmation without opening a private thread. If the rebuild fails, reopen the case or repair the template that allowed the gap. HR Coordinators records the result beside direct deposit profiles verified before payroll close so the check is not a one-time exercise."
